{"ordinal":14741,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452337770507","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Buddy_Armpit_0f1af7a","source":"Buddy: ...","target":"Buddy: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-373.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
